# DigiScreen control layer (gptokeyb) - gamepad to TUI keys
# A=save frame  B=quit stream (back to pairing)  X=render mode  Y=invert
# L1=help  R1=flip  L2/R2=pause  Start=pause  Guide=help
# Fully exit the port with the EmulationStation hotkey.

a = s
b = q
x = m
y = i
l1 = h
r1 = f
l2 = p
r2 = p
start = space
guide = h